OL,3,ABank of England expected to raise
OL,4,Ainterest rates for first time in more
OL,5,Athan three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank of England is expected to
OL,8,Fraise interest rates for the first time
OL,9,Fin more than three years when it
OL,10,Fannounces its latest decision at 12:00
OL,11,FGMT
OL,13,FMost economists expect the Bank's
OL,14,FMonetary Policy Committee (MPC) will
OL,15,Fraise interest rates from 3.75% to 4%
OL,17,FThe rate has remained unchanged for the
OL,18,Fgroup's past six meetings - in
OL,19,FSeptember, the Bank's governor said
OL,20,Frates could rise if energy prices
OL,21,Fremained high
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
